 lessonTitle:'What this educational simulation game teaches about velocity',
 lesson:'Speed tells you how fast something moves. Velocity includes direction. Average speed is total distance divided by elapsed time; average velocity is displacement divided by elapsed time. A turn can change velocity even if speed stays constant.',
